<text><body>
<div type="detail"><p>Artist unknown Granite obelisk date unknown Corner of Macarthur and The Avenue, Parkville</p>
<p>This austere granite obelisk was erected in memory of Lieutenant James C. Roberts, who died in the Boer War, fought between 1899 and 1902. As a child he played in Royal Park, where the memorial is located.</p></div>
